# Release checklist — do not ship until every box is ticked

## A. Build & signing
- [ ] versionName/versionCode bumped in app/build.gradle.kts
- [ ] release build with minify (R8) enabled; proguard rules verified
- [ ] AAB signed via Play App Signing (keystore backed up offline)
- [ ] zero secrets/keys inside AAB (scan: strings + resources)

## B. Compliance (Play Console)
- [ ] Privacy policy URL live and matching docs/PRIVACY_POLICY.md
- [ ] Data Safety form filled from docs/DATA_SAFETY.md (re-verify after any new SDK)
- [ ] Financial features declaration: non-custodial, no real orders,
      no withdrawal permission, paper-only simulation
- [ ] Content rating questionnaire completed
- [ ] Store listing copy = docs/STORE_LISTING.md (no forbidden claims:
      no "guaranteed profit", no "real-time" without server, no "insider")
- [ ] Target SDK meets current Play requirement (35+)
- [ ] Tester instructions for reviewers (how to see paper trading & alerts)

## C. Quality gates (closed testing, ≥7 days, ≥5 real devices)
- [ ] crash-free sessions ≥ 99%
- [ ] ANR rate ≈ 0
- [ ] zero signals displayed without source + timestamp
- [ ] zero "safe" labels where GoPlus status is EMPTY/FAILED
- [ ] zero chart shown without venue/synthesis disclosure
- [ ] notification denied path: no crash, honest banner shown
- [ ] offline path: disk-cache data labeled as cached, never "live"
- [ ] migration path tested: install old build → update → ledger intact & encrypted

## D. Rollout & rollback
- [ ] staged rollout: 5% → 20% → 50% → 100% (≥48h per step)
- [ ] stop criteria defined: crash spike, stale data unlabeled,
      wrong contract/pool deep links, misleading alert
- [ ] rollback build kept ready + changelog drafted for hotfix
- [ ] review monitoring plan (first 14 days), no rating manipulation

## E. Honesty audit (our own law)
- [ ] every UI number answers: from where? about which asset? when?
      what is missing? where is the evidence?
- [ ] CHANGELOG open-decisions list resolved (app label, support email)
